 style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">相片顯示工人在宏昌閣天台吸煙</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1183432-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E6%9C%89%E5%87%BA%E5%B8%AD%E8%81%BD%E8%AD%89%E6%9C%83%E5%B1%85%E6%B0%91%E6%8C%87%E5%B0%8D%E6%9F%A5%E6%89%BE%E7%9C%9F%E7%9B%B8%E8%B5%B0%E8%BF%91%E4%B8%80%E6%AD%A5%E5%86%80%E6%9C%80%E5%BE%8C%E8%83%BD%E5%BD%B0%E9%A1%AF%E5%85%AC%E7%BE%A9\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\"><span style='font-family: \"Segoe UI Symbol\", sans-serif;'>➢</span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">居民回應</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1183461-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E8%B2%A1%E5%A7%94%E6%9C%83%E9%80%9A%E9%81%8E%E8%BF%BD%E5%8A%A010%E5%84%84%E5%85%83%E6%92%A5%E6%AC%BE%E8%87%B350%E5%84%84%E5%85%83%E9%BB%83%E5%81%89%E7%B6%B8%E6%88%96%E5%AE%89%E6%8E%92%E5%B1%85%E6%B0%91%E5%86%8D%E4%B8%8A%E6%A8%93\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\"><span style='font-family: \"Segoe UI Symbol\", sans-serif;'>➢</span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">財委會通過追加十億撥款涵蓋8座樓宇業權收購</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1183426-%E5%9C%B0%E7%9B%A4%E4%BB%8A%E8%B5%B7%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E7%A6%81%E7%85%99%E5%8B%9E%E5%B7%A5%E8%99%95%E7%99%BC8%E5%BC%B5%E5%AE%9A%E9%A1%8D%E7%BD%B0%E6%AC%BE%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E6%9B%B8%E4%B8%A6%E6%93%AC%E6%8F%90%E4%B8%80%E5%AE%97%E6%AA%A2%E6%8E%A7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\"><span style='font-family: \"Segoe UI Symbol\", sans-serif;'>➢</span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">地盤全面禁煙</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">【新皇崗口岸條例草案通過】</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">立法會三讀通過《皇崗口岸港方口岸區條例草案》，保安局局長鄧炳強指，條例草案通過後會盡快就條例刊憲，並制訂相關附屬法例，之後會與深圳方合作推進各項準備工作，待口岸各環節準備穩妥及就緒後，會敲定開通日期並適時公布。</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1183419-%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E6%B8%AF%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E5%8D%80%E6%A2%9D%E4%BE%8B%E8%8D%89%E6%A1%88%E4%B8%89%E8%AE%80%E9%80%9A%E9%81%8E%E6%94%BF%E5%BA%9C%E6%8C%87%E6%9C%83%E9%81%A9%E6%99%82%E5%85%AC%E5%B8%83%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\"><span style='font-family: \"Segoe UI Symbol\", sans-serif;'>➢</span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">議員關注新口岸交通配套</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1183442-%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E5%8D%B3%E5%B0%87%E9%96%8B%E9%80%9A%E9%99%84%E8%BF%91%E5%95%86%E8%88%96%E5%8F%8A%E4%BD%8F%E5%AE%85%E5%B8%82%E9%81%93%E7%A7%9F%E9%87%91%E5%8D%87%E8%BF%91%E4%B8%80%E6%88%90\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\"><span style='font-family: \"Segoe UI Symbol\", sans-serif;'>➢</span><span style=\"font-family: 新細明體, serif;\">帶旺福田商舖及住宅市道</span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><a class=\"tiptap-link\" href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1183594-%E9%84%A7%E7%82%B3%E5%BC%B7%E6%8C%87%E6%9C%83%E7%A2%BA%E4%BF%9D%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E9%81%8B%E4%BD%9C%E6%9A%A2%E9%A0%86%E6%89%8D%E6%AD%A3%E5%BC%8F%E5%95%9F%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%A6%E5%B0%87%E5%96%84%E7%94%A8AI\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_self\